---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="页面未找到" noindex
  ><section class="not-found">
    <p class="eyebrow">404 · PAGE NOT FOUND</p><h1>这一页，还没有写下。</h1><p>
      链接可能有误，或者文章已经搬家。试试搜索，或回首页看看。
    </p><div>
      <a class="text-link" href="/">← 回到首页</a><a class="text-link" href="/search/">搜索文章 →</a
      >
    </div>
  </section></Base
>
<style>
  .not-found {
    min-height: 65vh;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: flex-start;
    padding: 50px 0;
  }
  .not-found h1 {
    font: 36px/1.5 var(--display);
    color: var(--ink);
    margin: 0;
  }
  .not-found > p:not(.eyebrow) {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 14px;
    max-width: 480px;
  }
  .not-found > div {
    display: flex;
    gap: 30px;
    margin-top: 22px;
  }
  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .not-found h1 {
      font-size: 28px;
    }
  }
</style>
